{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/psreader\/bookmarks"]},{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/psreader\/bookmarks"]}],"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader","doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Prebuilt-UI"]]},"seeAlsoSections":[{"generated":true,"title":"Features","identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Paywalls","doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Downloads-and-Offline-Reading","doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Search","doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Sharing","doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Commenting","doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Text-to-Speech","doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Advertisements","doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Media-and-Links","doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Analytics"],"anchor":"Features"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Overview","text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The prebuilt reader has a bookmark button in its navigation bar, and a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Bookmarks screen lists what the user saved. Each bookmark keeps its own","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"copy of the content, so it reopens without a network connection.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Building a custom UI? See ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Adding-a-Bookmark-Button","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The bookmark button needs no setup. To give users a place to find what","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"they saved, add the Bookmarks screen to the carousel as a section, or as","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a subsection beside your downloads:","type":"text"}]},{"wrap":0,"copyToClipboard":true,"lineAnnotations":[],"type":"codeListing","showLineNumbers":false,"syntax":"swift","code":["let carousel = CarouselViewController(","    globalConfig: globalConfig,","    sections: [","        .dynamicArchive(\"Editions\", shortcode: \"SHORTCODE\"),","        .section(.init(name: \"Bookmarks\", type: .bookmarks(type: .all)))","    ]",")"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"bookmarks-screen"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The reader’s bookmark button appears whenever the page on screen has"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"something to bookmark ("},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Adding-a-Bookmark-Button","type":"reference"},{"text":" lists what each","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"kind of page saves), and is highlighted once it’s saved. On a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"double-page spread, one tap saves both pages, or removes both when both","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"are saved.","type":"text"}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The Bookmarks screen lists saved articles and pages, most recently saved"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"first. Tapping one opens its edition at the bookmarked page when the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"edition is downloaded or the device is online; an edition that isn’t"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"downloaded streams, even with “Download while reading” on. Offline with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"no download, the screen opens the saved copies instead, and the user can"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"page through every saved item. The bookmark icon on an item removes it."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"In the carousel, the section’s ribbon has a menu that sorts the list by","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"save date or edition date, and deletes every bookmark after asking. The","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"menu appears in a section whose first subsection is Bookmarks or","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Downloads.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Every screen shares one store of bookmarks, so a bookmark saved in one","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"reader shows up on every Bookmarks screen.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Showing-Bookmarks-in-Your-Own-Navigation","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Showing Bookmarks in Your Own Navigation"},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/BookmarksViewController","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" is the same Bookmarks screen for your own","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"navigation. Outside the carousel it has no menu, so give it a sort"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"control of your own through"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/BookmarksViewController\/sortMode-swift.property","isActive":true},{"text":". The chosen order","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"persists across launches.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"copyToClipboard":true,"wrap":0,"lineAnnotations":[],"type":"codeListing","showLineNumbers":false,"syntax":"swift","code":["let bookmarks = BookmarksViewController(globalConfig: globalConfig, type: .all)","bookmarks.title = \"Bookmarks\"","bookmarks.navigationItem.rightBarButtonItem = UIBarButtonItem(","    image: UIImage(systemName: \"arrow.up.arrow.down\"),","    menu: UIMenu(children: [","        UIAction(title: \"Recently Saved\") { [weak bookmarks] _ in","            bookmarks?.sortMode = .byBookmarked","        },","        UIAction(title: \"Edition Date\") { [weak bookmarks] _ in","            bookmarks?.sortMode = .byDate","        }","    ])",")","","navigationController?.pushViewController(bookmarks, animated: true)"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"If a container of yours covers part of the screen, such as a custom tab","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"bar, set ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/BookmarksViewController\/additionalSafeAreaInsets"},{"type":"text","text":" to keep the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"list clear of it."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/FeedReaderViewController","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" has the same bookmark button as the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"carousel’s reader, and the screen shows bookmarks saved there as they’re"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"made."}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Configuring the Bookmarks Screen","anchor":"Configuring-the-Bookmarks-Screen","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The content type says which bookmarks the screen lists:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/BookmarksConfiguration\/BookmarkType\/feedArticle","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/BookmarksConfiguration\/BookmarkType\/feedPage","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" for articles and pages"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"saved from editions on the current system, or "},{"code":".all","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" for every kind."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Pass it as "},{"code":"type","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", in the carousel or to "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/BookmarksViewController","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/BookmarksConfiguration","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" styles the screen and sets up the reader it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"opens bookmarks in. Pass one as "},{"code":"config","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" in the carousel, or as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"bookmarksConfig","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" to "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/BookmarksViewController","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". Its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/BookmarksConfiguration\/readerConfig","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" starts with copies of your global"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"configuration’s delegates; change it to set up that reader alone:","type":"text"}]},{"code":["var bookmarksConfig = BookmarksConfiguration(globalConfig: globalConfig)","bookmarksConfig.bookmarkedIconColor = .systemOrange","bookmarksConfig.readerConfig.shareDelegate = ShareProvider(sharePolicy: .disabled)","","let bookmarks = BookmarksViewController(","    globalConfig: globalConfig,","    bookmarksConfig: bookmarksConfig,","    type: [.feedArticle, .feedPage]",")"],"showLineNumbers":false,"wrap":0,"copyToClipboard":true,"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","lineAnnotations":[]},{"inlineContent":[{"i